+// a committed entry, is being captured (the shared tab of a screen share
+// too), is audible or has playing media, has picture-in-picture or
+// fullscreen, an open permission or passkey request, or a download of its
+// own in progress; busy while a script or snapshot of the host's runs;
+// unsupported for a hosted DevTools frontend. The host does not ask for a tab
